# SoC-level XNU kernel configuration fragment for MT6899 (Dimensity 8400-Ultra).
#
# Every value must be derived from the MT6899 vendor DTB and kernel sources,
# reviewed against an identified source, and verified on hardware.
# Syntax matches Linux defconfig. See /porting/soc-support step 3 and
# /porting/device-repository#defconfig.
